{"id":"c7d3b5746093d796","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-oracle-minimal-graph.md","title":"极小停止串与前缀自由 oracle 图","display":"df-oracle-minimal-graph — 极小停止串与前缀自由 oracle 图","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-oracle-minimal-graph","aliases":["20-df-oracle-minimal-graph"],"display":"df-oracle-minimal-graph — 极小停止串与前缀自由 oracle 图","chapter":"3","section":"3.3.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definitions 3.3.1–3.3.4（use 改用查询上界约定）","source_printed_pages":[55],"source_pdf_pages":[91],"depends_on":["[[20-df-functional-graph]]","[[20-df-use]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-oracle-minimal-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-oracle-minimal-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oracle-minimal-graph — 极小停止串与前缀自由 oracle 图"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.3.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definitions 3.3.1–3.3.4（use 改用查询上界约定）"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>55</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"634b02102672cc2a\" href=\"?note=634b02102672cc2a\" title=\"20-df-functional-graph\">20-df-functional-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x\\in\\omega\">\\(e,x\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_e\">\\(G_e\\)</span> 见上游；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_e^\\sigma(x)\">\\(u_e^\\sigma(x)\\)</span> 是停止计算的最大查询数加 1，无查询时为 0。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"634b02102672cc2a\" href=\"?note=634b02102672cc2a\" title=\"20-df-functional-graph\">20-df-functional-graph</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle-minimal-graph}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nH_{e,x}:=\\{\\sigma:\\exists y\\ [(\\sigma,x,y)\\in G_e\\land u_e^\\sigma(x)=|\\sigma|]\\},\\\\\nF_e:=\\{(\\sigma,x,y)\\in G_e:\\sigma\\in H_{e,x}\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle-minimal-graph}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nH_{e,x}:=\\{\\sigma:\\exists y\\ [(\\sigma,x,y)\\in G_e\\land u_e^\\sigma(x)=|\\sigma|]\\},\\\\\nF_e:=\\{(\\sigma,x,y)\\in G_e:\\sigma\\in H_{e,x}\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定输入后，停止计算不再读取新位；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{e,x}\">\\(H_{e,x}\\)</span> 的串恰好覆盖全部被查询位置，故没有多余尾位。本目录 use 比原书“最大扫描位置”多 1，空串对应完全不查询的计算。检查是否停止以及该次计算的 use 都是有限计算，所以这些图可以有效枚举。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 3.3.1–3.3.4（use 改用查询上界约定）；印刷页 55；PDF 第 91 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-functional-graph","status":"resolved","id":"634b02102672cc2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-functional-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-use]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-functional-graph","status":"resolved","id":"634b02102672cc2a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-functional-graph]]；see [[20-df-use]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-functional-graph]]；see [[20-df-use]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e,x\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"G_e","display":false},{"tex":"u_e^\\sigma(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle-minimal-graph}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nH_{e,x}:=\\{\\sigma:\\exists y\\ [(\\sigma,x,y)\\in G_e\\land u_e^\\sigma(x)=|\\sigma|]\\},\\\\\nF_e:=\\{(\\sigma,x,y)\\in G_e:\\sigma\\in H_{e,x}\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"H_{e,x}","display":false}],"bytes":1525,"backlinks":[{"id":"cc503519ccb708ff","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-minimal-graph]]。"}],"outgoing":["634b02102672cc2a","4b1f1864d7fb1f2e"]}